        <name>as</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Converts the argument parsed for the LAST option parse result for the parent definition to the provided type. For example, if this was for &quot;-f 1
-f 2 -f 3&quot; then calling this method for an integer type will return 3. If there are no option parse results then a <ref refid="cpp/error/out_of_range" kindref="compound" external="/home/cim/pgr/pmai286/blacksmith/build-vg/_deps/argagg-src/doc/cppreference-doxygen-web.tag.xml">std::out_of_range</ref> exception is thrown. Any exceptions thrown by <ref refid="structargagg_1_1option__result_1acad0ebe8b52f37b25c6955b406ff809f" kindref="member">option_result::as()</ref> are not handled. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
